sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Requester
    participant UI as Student or TA dashboard
    participant Model as RoleRequestModel
    participant Requests as ROLE_REQUESTS
    actor Admin
    participant AdminUI as Admin dashboard
    participant Users as USERS
    participant Audit as AUDIT_LOG

    Requester->>UI: Open Role Request
    UI->>Model: submit request with reason
    Model->>Model: validate transition and reason
    Model->>Requests: INSERT status Pending
    Requests-->>Requester: Request ID and Pending state

    Admin->>AdminUI: Open Role Requests
    AdminUI->>Requests: SELECT pending
    Requests-->>AdminUI: Reason and clearance context

    alt Approved
        Admin->>AdminUI: Approve with comments
        AdminUI->>Users: UPDATE role and clearance
        AdminUI->>Requests: status Approved, processed metadata
    else Denied
        Admin->>AdminUI: Deny with comments
        AdminUI->>Requests: status Denied, processed metadata
    end

    AdminUI->>Audit: ROLE_REQUEST_PROCESSED
    Requester->>UI: Refresh status
    UI-->>Requester: Decision and admin comments
